PSQL Commands:

- To enable UTF-8 encoding for terminal run:
chcp 65001

- To enter the database run:
psql {External Database URL}

- To enable PostgreSQL table to display UTF-8 characters run:
\encoding UTF-8

\dt - list all tables
\d {table name} - show table details

SELECT * FROM {table name}

- The External Database URL is in your database provider's dashboard.
  Keep it in the DATABASE_URL environment variable; never commit it. Example:
psql "$DATABASE_URL"